<title>SIERRA LEONE: Arrests in Sierra Leone, accusations of coup plot.</title>
<headline>Arrests in Sierra Leone, accusations of coup plot.</headline>
<dateline>FREETOWN 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>- Sierra Leone's coup leaders arrested at least four senior officers and six civilians on Monday on suspicion of plotting a new coup, senior military officers said.</p>
<p>The suspects were being held at a barracks in the capital Freetown, the officers added. Junior army officers toppled Sierra Leone's elected civilian president, Ahmad Tejan Kabbah, on May 25.</p>
